{"segs": ["PA_ja_188:0.4"], "en": "8. The Sīhakotthu Jātaka:", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_188:1.1", "PA_ja_188:1.2"], "en": "“With lion-fingers and lion-claws, with feet planted like a lion’s;”", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_188:1.3", "PA_ja_188:1.4"], "en": "Thus the lion roars differently when alone than he does amidst the lion’s herd.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_188:2.1"], "en": "“Do not roar, O prince! [he said].", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_188:2.2"], "en": "Dwell in the forest making little noise;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_188:2.3"], "en": "they would know you by your voice,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_188:2.4"], "en": "for your voice is not like that of your ancestors.”", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
